<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE wheat futures dormant on U.S. moves.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE wheat futures dormant on U.S. moves.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat futures showed a muted reaction to overnight declines in CBOT wheat futures, with local contracts untraded.</p>
<p>Dealers said the market appeared stymied by developments at the CBOT, which trackled lower on speculative profit-taking.</p>
<p>Local participants at the Sydney Futures Exchange also ignored a A$2 a tonne rise in the estimated pool price announced by the Australian Wheat Board late on Monday.  </p>
